{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-953e1b5a4f7d829cde1c4335cdefbd3cc18d744a8b4ab7c2","family_id":"KR:002619","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Enforcement Decree of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act","title_original":"교통ㆍ에너지ㆍ환경세법 시행령","kind":"대통령령","source_version":"288439","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=288439","source_sha256":"6fddccc8dd40d065ba4af293d38ee89d2ecaf5b6b4ebb45961fc19ab8c83311e","body_sha256":"17c299d96ea434848a62e0fee7511e9af43db65676b2972af1ca774049bd6941","article_count":0,"full_text":"ADDENDA (Enforcement Decree of the Petroleum and Alternative Fuel Business Act) <Presidential Decree No. 18796, Apr. 22, 2005>\nArticle 1 (Enforcement date)\nThis Decree shall enter into force on April 23, 2005. (Proviso Omitted).\nArticles 2 and 3 Omitted.\nArticle 4 (Amendment of other statutes)\n(1) through (4) Omitted.\n(5) The Enforcement Decree of the Traffic Tax Act is partially amended as follows:\nIn Article 3 subparagraph 1 (b), \"Article 26 (2) of the Petroleum Business Act\" is replaced by \"Article 2 subparagraph 10 of the Petroleum and Alternative Fuel Business Act\"; in item (c) of that subparagraph, \"Article 26 (3) 4 of the Petroleum Business Act\" is replaced by \"Article 29 subparagraph 5 of the Petroleum and Alternative Fuel Business Act\"; in subparagraph 2 (b) of that Article, \"Article 26 (2) of the Petroleum Business Act\" is replaced by \"Article 2 subparagraph 10 of the Petroleum and Alternative Fuel Business Act\"; in the proviso to item (c) of that subparagraph, \"Article 26 (3) 4 of the Petroleum Business Act\" is replaced by \"Article 29 subparagraph 5 of the Petroleum and Alternative Fuel Business Act\"; and in Article 15 (3) 6, \"Petroleum Business Act\" is replaced by \"Petroleum and Alternative Fuel Business Act\".\n(6) through (20) Omitted.\nArticle 5 Omitted.\n","metadata":{"author_method